## Regenerating this file

The Python table comes from each pinned package's metadata on PyPI:

```bash
for spec in $(cat agent/requirements.lock hud/requirements.lock | grep -oE '^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+==[^ ]+' | sort -u); do
  curl -s "https://pypi.org/pypi/${spec%%==*}/${spec##*==}/json" \
    | python3 -c 'import json,sys; i=json.load(sys.stdin)["info"]; print(i["name"], i["version"], i.get("license_expression") or [c for c in i["classifiers"] if c.startswith("License")])'
done
```
